{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get Wiki Content or References"},"description":"Get reviewed Wiki article text, or a source reference when text is unavailable. Use search_wiki for titles; get_item_details for prices.\n- page takes one unencoded title; pages takes 1-10, e.g. [\"Abyssal whip\"]. URLs, #fragments and |separators reject the call before fetching.\n- For page, read the flat response. For pages, even one title, check results[i].error before reading results[i].data. Rows preserve order and duplicates; redirects resolve.\n- The server sets output contentStatus: reviewed_extract includes approved, unchanged text and attribution; successful link_only has null text, url and reason. Inputs cannot approve content.\n- In valid batches, missing-page/API errors are per row; the call fails only if all rows fail. At most two requests run concurrently; 429 stops queued work.\n- No authentication is required and responses are not cached here. Shared HTTP budget: 60 requests/IP/minute. Honor Retry-After.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"oneOf":[{"required":["page"]},{"required":["pages"]}],"properties":{"page":{"description":"Wiki page title (spaces allowed; redirects are followed)","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"pages":{"description":"Wiki titles for a reference batch; exclusive with page","items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_wiki_page_content","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"oneOf":[{"required":["title","url","revisionId","contentStatus","text","reason","attribution"]},{"required":["results","succeeded","failed"]}],"properties":{"attribution":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"author":{"type":"string"},"changes":{"type":"string"},"copyrightNotices":{"items":{"type":"